{"item_uid": "指考98-physics-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如圖 4 所示，一發光點從凸面鏡主軸上的 P 點沿主軸緩慢向鏡頂 O 移動，則此光點\n的像，其位置以及其移動的方向為下列哪一項？", "options": {"A": "先成像於鏡前，接著成像於鏡後 鏡後 鏡前", "B": "成像於鏡後，遠離O點移動\n發光點", "C": "成像於鏡後，朝向O點移動 O\n●", "D": "成像於鏡前，遠離O點移動 P", "E": "成像於鏡前，朝向O點移動\n圖 4"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 47.0, "D": 11.0, "E": 12.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 8.0, "C": 69.0, "D": 6.0, "E": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 16.0, "E": 14.0}, "omit_rate": 15.0, "p_value": 47.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 42.0, "p_quintiles": [76.0, 56.0, 44.0, 35.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-physics-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在近代科技的領域中，下列敘述何者錯錯錯錯誤誤誤誤？", "options": {"A": "雷射可用於光纖通信", "B": "純矽的晶體摻入少量三價元素後可製成p型半導體", "C": "即使超導體在超導狀態，其電阻也不會是零", "D": "利用外在電場可改變液晶的光學特性", "E": "奈米是一個長度單位"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 16.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 48.0, "D": 14.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 9.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 72.0, "D": 12.0, "E": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 23.0, "B": 16.0, "C": 26.0, "D": 16.0, "E": 6.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 48.0, "p_high": 72.0, "p_low": 26.0, "discrimination": 46.0, "p_quintiles": [79.0, 60.0, 47.0, 34.0, 21.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-physics-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如圖 5 所示，一水管水平放置，水以 1.50 kg/s 的固定速率，穩定地從甲截面流入，\n從乙截面流出。已知甲截面的面積為 12.0 cm2，乙截面的面積為 5.00 cm2。假設管\n內同一截面上各點的流速相等，則甲截面的水流速 v 和乙截面的水流速 v 各為下列\n甲 乙\n哪一項？\nv v 甲", "options": {"A": "= 3.00 m/s， = 1.50 m/s\n甲 乙\nv v 乙", "B": "= 2.50 m/s， = 1.50 m/s\n甲 乙", "C": "v = 1.25 m/s， v = 3.00 m/s\n甲 乙", "D": "v = 1.00 m/s， v = 3.00 m/s\n甲 乙", "E": "v = 1.00 m/s， v = 4.25 m/s\n甲 乙 圖 5"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 73.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 93.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 3.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 50.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 18.0, "p_value": 73.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 50.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 86.0, 76.0, 65.0, 41.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-physics-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "在一開口水槽的平靜水面上，將一半徑為 2.5 cm、質量為 2.4 g 細鋁線製成的圓圈\n（鋁的密度為 2.70 g/cm3），輕輕平放該水面上而不下沉，則水的表面張力最可能是\n下列哪一項？", "options": {"A": "7.5×10-2 N/m", "B": "1.5×10-1 N/m", "C": "1.2×10-2 N/m2", "D": "2.4×10-2 N/m2", "E": "2.4×10-2 N\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 98年指考\n共 7 頁 物理考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 21.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 10.0, "E": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 48.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 3.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 17.0, "E": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 46.0, "p_value": 21.0, "p_high": 48.0, "p_low": 4.0, "discrimination": 44.0, "p_quintiles": [61.0, 24.0, 9.0, 5.0, 4.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-physics-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "有一平行板電容器，內部抽成真空，其中一板帶正電，另一板帶等量的負電。已知\n當兩個電極板的間距為 1.2 cm 時，電容器內部電場的強度為 25 kV/m。若此電容器\n兩電極板間的電位差維持不變，但兩極板的間距變為 2.0 cm 時，則電容器內部電場\n的強度為下列哪一項？", "options": {"A": "30 kV/m", "B": "24 kV/m", "C": "18 kV/m", "D": "15 kV/m", "E": "10 kV/m"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 66.0, "E": 3.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 93.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 5.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 33.0, "E": 5.0}, "omit_rate": 21.0, "p_value": 66.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 60.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 87.0, 70.0, 51.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-physics-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如圖 6 所示，甲、乙、丙、丁四個方形線圈以相同水平速度 v 分別進入垂直射出紙\n面的均勻磁場 B 中，四個線圈的邊長如圖所示之尺寸，則在四個線圈剛進入磁場時，\n它們的感應電動勢的量值之關係為下列何者？\n3L 3L 2L\nL\nL 2L 2L 3L\n甲 乙 丙 丁\n圖 6", "options": {"A": "甲=丁<丙<乙", "B": "甲>乙>丙>丁", "C": "丁>丙>乙>甲", "D": "甲=乙>丙>丁", "E": "丁>丙=乙>甲"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "E", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 21.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 63.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 0.0, "E": 92.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 32.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 7.0, "E": 31.0}, "omit_rate": 10.0, "p_value": 63.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 31.0, "discrimination": 61.0, "p_quintiles": [96.0, 84.0, 66.0, 44.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-physics-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "一重為 W=mg 的長方形物體（g 為重力加速度），靜置於一以等速度 v、水平向右\n直線行駛的火車車箱內的地板上，火車質量為 M。當火車以等加速度 a 向右加速時，\n若物體相對火車車箱而言，仍然維持在原地不動，忽略空氣阻力，則對地面上的觀\n察者而言，有關此時物體的受力及運動，下列敘述哪一項是正確的？", "options": {"A": "物體未受力，故仍然可在原地不動", "B": "物體受一大小為Ma、向左的摩擦力，以維持在原地不動", "C": "物體受一大小為Ma、向右的摩擦力，以維持等加速度運動", "D": "物體受一大小為ma、向左的摩擦力，以維持在原地不動", "E": "物體受一大小為ma、向右的摩擦力，以維持等加速度運動"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "E", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 19.0, "E": 49.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 7.0, "E": 82.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 31.0, "E": 19.0}, "omit_rate": 6.0, "p_value": 49.0, "p_high": 82.0, "p_low": 19.0, "discrimination": 63.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 66.0, 45.0, 30.0, 14.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考98-physics-013", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 98, "year_ce": 2009, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 13, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "如圖 7 所示，一質量為 m 的棒球以速度 v 水平飛向擊球手，擊球手揮棒擊球，使球\n以速度 v 鉛垂向上飛出，設水平飛行方向為+x，鉛垂向上飛出方向為+y，則球所受\n到衝量的量值及方向為下列何者？", "options": {"A": "2mv，向+y方向 v", "B": "mv，與+x方向成45°\nv", "C": "mv，與+x方向成135°", "D": "2mv ，與+x方向成45° y\n球棒", "E": "2mv ，與+x方向成135°\nx\n圖 7\n- 3 -\n98年指考 第 4 頁\n物理考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "E", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 26.0, "E": 52.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 16.0, "E": 83.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 7.0, "D": 29.0, "E": 22.0}, "omit_rate": 14.0, "p_value": 52.0, "p_high": 83.0, "p_low": 22.0, "discrimination": 61.0, "p_quintiles": [89.0, 70.0, 49.0, 34.0, 17.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
